# Nothing in this folder is for the web. Its scripts run on the server from
# the command line (wp eval-file, php, bash) during deploys and diagnostics,
# and its data files are read from disk by those scripts.
#
# Closed with a rewrite rule: this host's LiteSpeed ignores "Require all
# denied" in a folder's .htaccess (checked live on 12 Oct: every file here was
# served), but it does follow rewrite rules there, as
# wp-content/uploads/.htaccess shows. Each PHP script also refuses web
# requests by itself (its AF-WEB-GUARD line).
<IfModule mod_rewrite.c>
RewriteEngine On
RewriteRule ^ - [F,L]
</IfModule>
